  "prefLabel": "Plc 1105.05 Application for License Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1105.05 Application for License Renewal. A licensed practitioner who wishes to continue to practice in New Hampshire shall apply for renewal by complying with Plc 308.05, subject to the following:\n\n(a) No profession-specific supplement shall be required;\n\n(b) The fee shall be the application processing and licensing fee for renewal specified in Plc 1002.47, provided that an applicant who is active military or a military spouse shall not pay the fee; and\n\n(c) The applicant shall provide proof of continued certification by the applicable national certifying organization.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1100) #13391, eff 5-27-22; ss by #14444, eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES: 1-26-36 (formerly Plc 1105.01)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1100.html"
